The driver provides support for the on‐die digital thermal sensor
present  on  AMD  K8, AMD Barcelona, AMD Phenom, AMD Griffin, AMD
Fusion, AMD Bobcat, and AMD Puma CPUs.  These sensors were  offi‐
cially  introduced  in  AMD K8 Revision F processors, and provide
0.5°C accuracy.  Precision was  improved  in  Revision  G  chips,
which  provide two more bits for 0.25°C steppings.  Each core has
two temperature sensors, and there are up to two  cores  per  CPU
socket.   AMD Barcelona, AMD Phenom, AMD Griffin, AMD Fusion, AMD
Bobcat, and AMD Puma provide 0.125°gC accuracy  and  provide  one
temperature  sensor for each CPU socket.  The driver reports tem‐
peratures through the API.  The driver first appeared in named It
was then ported to The driver has been renamed with  support  for
newer  AMD CPUs.  The driver was written by whilst at the Univer‐
